<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</title>
<headline>Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government is issuing three-month money market claims to be paid for on December 5, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The allocation follows the end of subscriptions on December 3.</p>
<p>The previous issue of three-month claims, paid for on November 28, raised 1,140.75 million francs and was priced at 99.685 percent to yield 1.250 percent annually.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
